# Title: Always Install Elevated MSI Spawned Cmd And Powershell
# ID: 1e53dd56-8d83-4eb4-a43e-b790a05510aa
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea), Mangatas Tondang (rule), oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-13
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
# Description: Detects Windows Installer service (msiexec.exe) spawning "cmd" or "powershell"
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((((process_path="*\\cmd.exe" OR process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe")) OR ((process_name="Cmd.Exe" OR process_name="PowerShell.EXE" OR process_name="pwsh.dll"))) AND ((parent_process_path="*\\Windows\\Installer\\*" AND parent_process_path="*msi*") AND parent_process_path="*tmp"))
